+/*
+
+ 802.11 data frame from AP
+
+      ,-------------------------------------------------------------------.
+Bytes |  2   |  2   |    6    |    6    |    6    |  2   | 0..2312 |   4  |
+      |------|------|---------|---------|---------|------|---------|------|
+Desc. | ctrl | dura |  DA/RA  |   TA    |    SA   | Sequ |  frame  |  fcs |
+      |      | tion | (BSSID) |         |         | ence |  data   |      |
+      `-------------------------------------------------------------------'
+
+Total: 28-2340 bytes
+
+*/
+
